<</if>>


:: DM_3_Choix
<<if $difficile>>
	<div class="elle"><<print either("brb", "k", "...")>></div>
<<else>>
	<div class="elle"><<print either("btw my dog says hi 🐶", "sorry my cat walked on my keyboard jjjjjjjjjjjjj", "I just tripped over nothing lol 🙃")>></div>
<</if>>
<div class="choix">
	[[You have beautiful eyes 😍|DM_Oeufs]]
	[[🎞️ Send a GIF|DM_Shrek]]
	[[(Say nothing. Wait for her to talk.)|DM_Attendre]]
</div>

